<title>TURKEY: Turk Emlak launches 5-year 150-mln mark Eurobond.</title>
<headline>Turk Emlak launches 5-year 150-mln mark Eurobond.</headline>
<dateline>ISTANBUL 1997-06-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Turkey's state-run Emlakbank launched a five-year 150-million mark Eurobond issue on Monday, the bank said in a statement.</p>
<p>It did not give any further detail on the cost of the issue, managed jointly by Commerzbank and UBS.</p>
<p>The accord for the issue will be signed on July 4 in Istanbul.</p>
</text>
